%% Approval Workflow — amount-based routing and escalation chain
flowchart TD
    START([Requester raises request<br/>Head / Activity In-charge]) --> ITEMS[Add budget items<br/>qty, unit cost, estimated total]
    ITEMS --> TOTAL{{Tentative total computed}}
    TOTAL --> ROUTE{Route by amount}

    ROUTE -->|under 50,000| PC[Purchase Committee<br/>UNDER_PURCHASE_COMMITTEE_REVIEW]
    ROUTE -->|50,000 to under 5 lakh| PRIN[Principal<br/>UNDER_PRINCIPAL_REVIEW]
    ROUTE -->|5 lakh and above| CDC[CDC<br/>Grant + Non-Grant Members<br/>UNDER_CDC_REVIEW]

    PC --> PCD{Decision}
    PCD -->|Approve| APPROVED[APPROVED]
    PCD -->|Partial Approve| PARTIAL[PARTIALLY_APPROVED]
    PCD -->|Reject| REJECTED[REJECTED]
    PCD -->|Escalate| PRIN

    PRIN --> PRD{Decision}
    PRD -->|Approve| APPROVED
    PRD -->|Partial Approve| PARTIAL
    PRD -->|Reject| REJECTED
    PRD -->|Escalate| CDC

    CDC --> CDCD{Decision}
    CDCD -->|Approve| APPROVED
    CDCD -->|Partial Approve| PARTIAL
    CDCD -->|Reject| REJECTED
    CDCD -->|Escalate| FA[Chairman + Vice Chairman<br/>UNDER_FINAL_AUTHORITY_REVIEW]

    FA --> FAD{Decision - final}
    FAD -->|Approve| APPROVED
    FAD -->|Partial Approve| PARTIAL
    FAD -->|Reject| REJECTED

    APPROVED --> FUL[FULFILMENT_PENDING]
    PARTIAL --> FUL
    FUL --> BILL[Record purchase bill<br/>and inventory entry]
    BILL --> DONE[FULFILLED then CLOSED]

    REJECTED --> NOTIFY[Notify requester<br/>with reason and signature]

    FUL -.->|FY ends unfinished| CF[CARRIED_FORWARD<br/>new FY request linked<br/>original preserved]

    subgraph SIDE[At every decision]
        direction TB
        S1[Digital signature]
        S2[Comment with visibility scope]
        S3[approval_actions row]
        S4[Notification to next stage]
        S5[audit_logs entry]
    end

    PCD -.-> SIDE
    PRD -.-> SIDE
    CDCD -.-> SIDE
    FAD -.-> SIDE
